{"seq":1,"slug":"function-calling-spec","title":"函数调用规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/function-calling/function-calling-spec","wordCount":1138,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"函数调用规范\">函数调用规范</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Function Calling 是 LLM 与外部世界交互的核心机制。模型本身无法执行代码、查询数据库或调用 API，但它可以生成结构化的函数调用请求，由应用程序代理执行后将结果返回给模型继续推理。这一机制将 LLM 从「只会说话」升级为「能做事情」的智能体。</p>\n<p>围绕它有三个必须分清的层面：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>声明</strong>：在请求的 <code>tools</code> 数组中用 JSON Schema 描述「有哪些工具、每个工具要什么参数」，这是你交给模型的「可调用能力清单」。</li>\n<li><strong>决策</strong>：模型根据工具描述与用户意图，自主判断「这一轮要不要调用、调用哪个、参数填什么」，输出结构化的 <code>tool_calls</code>。它不是规则匹配，而是训练习得的模式。</li>\n<li><strong>执行与回灌</strong>：真正的函数在你的代码里执行，结果作为 tool message 回传给模型，供其生成最终回复。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层面</th>\n<th>发生在哪里</th>\n<th>产物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>声明</td>\n<td>你的请求体</td>\n<td><code>tools</code> 数组（名称/描述/Schema）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策</td>\n<td>模型推理</td>\n<td><code>tool_calls</code>（工具名 + 参数）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行</td>\n<td>你的应用程序</td>\n<td>函数返回值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回灌</td>\n<td>你的应用程序</td>\n<td>tool message → 模型生成最终回复</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>tool_choice</code> 是这条链路上的控制阀：<code>auto</code> 让模型自主决定，<code>required</code> 强制调用，也可锁定到具体工具。理解这三层，是构建可靠工具调用系统的基础。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"什么是-function-calling\">什么是 Function Calling</h2><p>Function Calling 是 LLM 与外部世界交互的核心机制。模型本身无法执行代码、查询数据库或调用 API，但它可以生成结构化的函数调用请求，由应用程序代理执行后将结果返回给模型继续推理。这一机制将 LLM 从&quot;只会说话&quot;升级为&quot;能做事情&quot;的智能体。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant App as 应用程序&#10;    participant LLM as 大语言模型&#10;    participant Tool as 外部工具&#10;&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;LLM: 发送消息 + 工具定义&#10;    LLM--&gt;&gt;App: 返回 tool_calls(函数名 + 参数)&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Tool: 执行函数调用&#10;    Tool--&gt;&gt;App: 返回执行结果&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;LLM: 将结果作为 tool message 发送&#10;    LLM--&gt;&gt;App: 基于结果生成最终回复\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App as 应用程序\n    participant LLM as 大语言模型\n    participant Tool as 外部工具\n\n    App-&gt;&gt;LLM: 发送消息 + 工具定义\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;App: 返回 tool_calls(函数名 + 参数)\n    App-&gt;&gt;Tool: 执行函数调用\n    Tool--&gt;&gt;App: 返回执行结果\n    App-&gt;&gt;LLM: 将结果作为 tool message 发送\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;App: 基于结果生成最终回复</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"function-与-tool-的区别\">Function 与 Tool 的区别</h2><p>OpenAI 在早期使用 <code>functions</code> 参数，后来统一迁移到 <code>tools</code> 参数。两者的核心区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>functions（已废弃）</th>\n<th>tools（当前标准）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>API 参数</td>\n<td><code>functions</code> + <code>function_call</code></td>\n<td><code>tools</code> + <code>tool_choice</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用方式</td>\n<td>单次调用</td>\n<td>支持并行多次调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回格式</td>\n<td><code>function_call</code> 字段</td>\n<td><code>tool_calls</code> 数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型标识</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>每个 tool 有 <code>type: &quot;function&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 AI SDK 6 中，统一使用 <code>tools</code> 概念，不再区分 function 与 tool。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"api-请求格式\">API 请求格式</h2><p>一个完整的 Function Calling 请求需要在 <code>tools</code> 中声明可用工具，每个工具包含名称、描述和 JSON Schema 参数定义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;model&quot;: &quot;gpt-5&quot;,&#10;  &quot;messages&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;role&quot;: &quot;user&quot;,&#10;      &quot;content&quot;: &quot;北京今天天气怎么样？&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;tools&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;function&quot;,&#10;      &quot;function&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;getWeather&quot;,&#10;        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;获取指定城市的当前天气信息&quot;,&#10;        &quot;parameters&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot;,&#10;          &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;city&quot;: {&#10;              &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;              &quot;description&quot;: &quot;城市名称，例如：北京、上海&quot;&#10;            },&#10;            &quot;unit&quot;: {&#10;              &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;              &quot;enum&quot;: [&quot;celsius&quot;, &quot;fahrenheit&quot;],&#10;              &quot;description&quot;: &quot;温度单位&quot;&#10;            }&#10;          },&#10;          &quot;required&quot;: [&quot;city&quot;]&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;tool_choice&quot;: &quot;auto&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpt-5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"messages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"北京今天天气怎么样？\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tools\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"getWeather\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"获取指定城市的当前天气信息\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"parameters\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"object\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"city\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"城市名称，例如：北京、上海\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"enum\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"celsius\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fahrenheit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"温度单位\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"city\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tool_choice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>模型返回的响应中包含 <code>tool_calls</code> 数组：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;choices&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;message&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;role&quot;: &quot;assistant&quot;,&#10;        &quot;content&quot;: null,&#10;        &quot;tool_calls&quot;: [&#10;          {&#10;            &quot;id&quot;: &quot;call_abc123&quot;,&#10;            &quot;type&quot;: &quot;function&quot;,&#10;            &quot;function&quot;: {&#10;              &quot;name&quot;: &quot;getWeather&quot;,&#10;              &quot;arguments&quot;: &quot;{\\&quot;city\\&quot;:\\&quot;北京\\&quot;,\\&quot;unit\\&quot;:\\&quot;celsius\\&quot;}&quot;&#10;            }&#10;          }&#10;        ]&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;finish_reason&quot;: &quot;tool_calls&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"choices\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"assistant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"tool_calls\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"call_abc123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"getWeather\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"arguments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">city</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">北京</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">unit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">celsius</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"finish_reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tool_calls\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"tool_choice-控制策略\">tool_choice 控制策略</h2><p><code>tool_choice</code> 参数决定模型如何选择是否调用工具：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&quot;auto&quot;</code></td>\n<td>模型自主决定是否调用工具</td>\n<td>通用对话场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&quot;none&quot;</code></td>\n<td>禁止调用任何工具</td>\n<td>纯文本回复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&quot;required&quot;</code></td>\n<td>必须调用至少一个工具</td>\n<td>强制执行操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;function&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;getWeather&quot;}}</code></td>\n<td>强制调用指定工具</td>\n<td>明确知道需要哪个工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 AI SDK 6 中使用 <code>toolChoice</code> 参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { generateText } from &#39;ai&#39;;&#10;import { openai } from &#39;@ai-sdk/openai&#39;;&#10;&#10;const result = await generateText({&#10;  model: openai(&#39;gpt-5&#39;),&#10;  prompt: &#39;北京今天天气怎么样？&#39;,&#10;  tools: {&#10;    /* ... */&#10;  },&#10;  toolChoice: &#39;required&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { generateText } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { openai } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ai-sdk/openai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openai</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prompt: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'北京今天天气怎么样？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tools: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    /* ... */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  toolChoice: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'required'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"json-schema-参数定义\">JSON Schema 参数定义</h2><p>工具参数通过 JSON Schema 定义，模型依据 Schema 生成符合要求的参数。常用的 Schema 类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const searchToolSchema = {&#10;  type: &#39;object&#39; as const,&#10;  properties: {&#10;    query: {&#10;      type: &#39;string&#39;,&#10;      description: &#39;搜索关键词&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;    maxResults: {&#10;      type: &#39;number&#39;,&#10;      description: &#39;最大返回条数&#39;,&#10;      minimum: 1,&#10;      maximum: 50,&#10;    },&#10;    filters: {&#10;      type: &#39;object&#39;,&#10;      properties: {&#10;        dateRange: {&#10;          type: &#39;string&#39;,&#10;          enum: [&#39;today&#39;, &#39;week&#39;, &#39;month&#39;, &#39;year&#39;],&#10;        },&#10;        language: {&#10;          type: &#39;string&#39;,&#10;          description: &#39;结果语言，ISO 639-1 编码&#39;,&#10;        },&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;    tags: {&#10;      type: &#39;array&#39;,&#10;      items: { type: &#39;string&#39; },&#10;      description: &#39;过滤标签列表&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  required: [&#39;query&#39;],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> searchToolSchema</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'object'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  properties: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    query: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'string'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'搜索关键词'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxResults: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'number'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'最大返回条数'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      minimum: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      maximum: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    filters: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'object'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      properties: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dateRange: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'string'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          enum: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'today'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'week'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'year'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        language: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'string'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'结果语言，ISO 639-1 编码'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tags: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'array'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      items: { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'string'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'过滤标签列表'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  required: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'query'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>description</code> 字段极为关键。模型依赖描述信息理解参数含义，清晰的描述能显著提高参数生成的准确性。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"模型如何决策调用\">模型如何决策调用</h2><p>LLM 决定是否调用函数的过程并非规则匹配，而是基于训练中学习到的模式。模型会综合考量以下因素：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    INPUT[&quot;用户消息&quot;] --&gt; ANALYZE[&quot;分析用户意图&quot;]&#10;    ANALYZE --&gt; CHECK{&quot;需要外部信息？&quot;}&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| MATCH[&quot;匹配可用工具&quot;]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| DIRECT[&quot;直接生成文本回复&quot;]&#10;    MATCH --&gt; SELECT{&quot;找到合适工具？&quot;}&#10;    SELECT --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| GENERATE[&quot;生成 tool_calls&quot;]&#10;    SELECT --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| DIRECT&#10;    GENERATE --&gt; EXTRACT[&quot;提取参数值&quot;]&#10;    EXTRACT --&gt; VALIDATE[&quot;验证参数完整性&quot;]&#10;    VALIDATE --&gt; OUTPUT[&quot;输出结构化调用&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    INPUT[\"用户消息\"] --&gt; ANALYZE[\"分析用户意图\"]\n    ANALYZE --&gt; CHECK{\"需要外部信息？\"}\n    CHECK --&gt;|\"是\"| MATCH[\"匹配可用工具\"]\n    CHECK --&gt;|\"否\"| DIRECT[\"直接生成文本回复\"]\n    MATCH --&gt; SELECT{\"找到合适工具？\"}\n    SELECT --&gt;|\"是\"| GENERATE[\"生成 tool_calls\"]\n    SELECT --&gt;|\"否\"| DIRECT\n    GENERATE --&gt; EXTRACT[\"提取参数值\"]\n    EXTRACT --&gt; VALIDATE[\"验证参数完整性\"]\n    VALIDATE --&gt; OUTPUT[\"输出结构化调用\"]</pre><p>影响模型决策的关键因素：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因素</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工具描述质量</td>\n<td>清晰的 <code>description</code> 让模型更准确地判断何时调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数描述</td>\n<td>每个参数的描述帮助模型提取正确的值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户意图匹配</td>\n<td>用户消息与工具功能的语义相关性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tool_choice</td>\n<td>显式控制覆盖模型的自主判断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具数量</td>\n<td>工具过多会增加选择难度，建议控制在 20 个以内</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"完整调用流程示例\">完整调用流程示例</h2><p>在 Hono 后端中实现一个完整的 Function Calling 流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Hono } from &#39;hono&#39;;&#10;import { generateText } from &#39;ai&#39;;&#10;import { openai } from &#39;@ai-sdk/openai&#39;;&#10;import { z } from &#39;zod&#39;;&#10;import { tool } from &#39;ai&#39;;&#10;&#10;const app = new Hono();&#10;&#10;app.post(&#39;/api/chat&#39;, async (c) =&gt; {&#10;  const { messages } = await c.req.json();&#10;&#10;  const result = await generateText({&#10;    model: openai(&#39;gpt-5&#39;),&#10;    messages,&#10;    tools: {&#10;      getWeather: tool({&#10;        description: &#39;获取指定城市的当前天气信息&#39;,&#10;        inputSchema: z.object({&#10;          city: z.string().describe(&#39;城市名称&#39;),&#10;          unit: z.enum([&#39;celsius&#39;, &#39;fahrenheit&#39;]).optional().describe(&#39;温度单位&#39;),&#10;        }),&#10;        execute: async ({ city, unit = &#39;celsius&#39; }) =&gt; {&#10;          const response = await fetch(`https://api.weather.example/v1/current?city=${city}&amp;unit=${unit}`);&#10;          return response.json();&#10;        },&#10;      }),&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return c.json({ text: result.text, toolResults: result.toolResults });&#10;});&#10;&#10;export default app;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Hono } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hono'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { generateText } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { openai } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ai-sdk/openai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { z } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'zod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { tool } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Hono</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/chat'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">messages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.req.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openai</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    messages,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tools: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      getWeather: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'获取指定城市的当前天气信息'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        inputSchema: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          city: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'城市名称'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          unit: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'celsius'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fahrenheit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">optional</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'温度单位'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">city</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">unit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'celsius'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`https://api.weather.example/v1/current?city=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">city</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}&#x26;unit=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">unit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ text: result.text, toolResults: result.toolResults });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Function Calling 是 LLM 从对话系统迈向智能体的关键能力。OpenAI 规范通过 <code>tools</code> 参数声明可用工具，用 JSON Schema 定义参数结构，用 <code>tool_choice</code> 控制调用策略。模型根据工具描述和用户意图自主决定是否调用函数，并生成结构化的 <code>tool_calls</code> 响应。在 AI SDK 6 中，这一过程被进一步简化——通过 <code>tool()</code> 函数将参数定义、描述和执行逻辑封装在一起，开发者只需关注业务逻辑本身。理解这套规范是构建可靠工具调用系统的基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"函数调用规范","id":"函数调用规范"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是 Function Calling","id":"什么是-function-calling"},{"level":2,"text":"Function 与 Tool 的区别","id":"function-与-tool-的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"API 请求格式","id":"api-请求格式"},{"level":2,"text":"tool_choice 控制策略","id":"tool_choice-控制策略"},{"level":2,"text":"JSON Schema 参数定义","id":"json-schema-参数定义"},{"level":2,"text":"模型如何决策调用","id":"模型如何决策调用"},{"level":2,"text":"完整调用流程示例","id":"完整调用流程示例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"React Chat 组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/streaming-and-chat/react-chat-ui"},"next":{"title":"结构化输出","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/function-calling/structured-output"}}